# Vercel upload exclusions.
#
# The CLI uploads the working tree, not just committed files, so anything
# gitignored has to be excluded here too — most importantly `.env*`, which is
# where scripts/localnet.sh writes the LocalNet ledger URL and party map. Those
# are localhost values and must never reach a deployment.

.env*
node_modules
.next
out
tsconfig.tsbuildinfo

# Daml build output and LocalNet runtime files
daml/.daml
daml/log
.localnet-init.json
.localnet-pids
.localnet-sandbox.log

# Generated brag/marketing media (large, not part of the site)
brag-output
